# Itinerary voting (docs/specs/voting-spec.md). A search on a trip with 2+ members returns a roundId.

### Open and recent rounds of a trip (any member)
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/rounds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One round. OWNER: tally with likedBy + voters. Members: tally (counts only) after closesAt. 404 ROUND_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/rounds/{{roundId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vote (any member, idempotent). 409 VOTING_CLOSED after closesAt or once decided
PUT {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/rounds/{{roundId}}/votes/{{placeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "vote": "LIKE" }

### Undo a vote
DELETE {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/rounds/{{roundId}}/votes/{{placeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Decide (OWNER). Create the itinerary items first (normal path), then this. 409 ROUND_ALREADY_DECIDED
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/rounds/{{roundId}}/decide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "placeIds": ["{{placeId}}"] }

### Next batch for the same round (only the one who searched, while open)
POST {{host}}/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "tripId": "{{tripId}}", "priceLevel": "MEDIUM", "interests": ["NATURE"], "style": "SANTAI", "newSearch": false, "roundId": "{{roundId}}" }
